Using only the supplied evidence, analyze the separate City of Los Angeles settlement (also identify any subsequent payment explicitly reported in the packet) from the perspective of a senior unsecured creditor of Sempra Energy, as of March 26, 2007, immediately after signing. Use three labeled sections: Obligation map; Creditor implications; Evidence limits. Cite excerpt IDs for material claims and distinguish direct evidence from your inferences. Focus on the specified arrangement and date.

